{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new kind of companion with Talking Jellyfish AI, a charming and intelligent virtual being for your desktop. More than just a program, this is an interactive experience that allows you to have seamless, voice-driven conversations with a curious and knowledgeable AI, all embodied by a serene, floating jellyfish. At its heart, Talking Jellyfish AI is a seamless conversational loop. Powered by state-of-the-art technology, you can speak naturally through your microphone, and the jellyfish will listen. Its advanced AI brain processes your words, thinks, and formulates a unique, intelligent response in real-time, speaking back to you with its own distinct voice. There are no menus to navigate or complex commands to learn\u2014just speak, and it will answer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925140?t=1755706858","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3925140?t=1755706858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925140/c969c17a200465ef4c79ec0281e964846eaf6c67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755706858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3925140/c969c17a200465ef4c79ec0281e964846eaf6c67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755706858","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a new kind of companion with Talking Jellyfish AI, a charming and intelligent virtual being for your desktop. More than just a program, this is an interactive experience that allows you to have seamless, voice-driven conversations with a curious an